    {
      "id": "seg:heading:discussion:0007:0001",
      "source": "Discussion",
      "ko": "Discussion",
      "sourceHash": "5eb6cf647d2c5d14a044e2d103dcef4cf0cdc872434c374debc1043092bc4746",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "On devices equipped with a dual camera, image fusion combines samples from both cameras to produce a higher quality image.",
      "ko": "Setting a [`sessionPreset`](avcapturesession/sessionpreset.md) value provides a convenient way to configure a capture session for common use cases.",
      "sourceHash": "38f22b6c61cb80ee7831ab35d11e0675577a8d7f26f84ac2c9a0bdc51fcbe081",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "To capture a photo with image fusion, set the [`isAutoDualCameraFusionEnabled`](avcapturephotosettings/isautodualcamerafusionenabled.md) property of your photo settings object.",
      "ko": "이미지 퓨전으로 사진을 촬영하려면 photo settings 객체의 [`isAutoDualCameraFusionEnabled`](avcapturephotosettings/isautodualcamerafusionenabled.md) 속성을 설정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e928cc65fbdd5cb7c7c385987ef223cb793725926a2729f35b64058e8334f976",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "If a device does not support image fusion, setting the [`isAutoDualCameraFusionEnabled`](avcapturephotosettings/isautodualcamerafusionenabled.md) property has no effect (that is, the resolved [`isDualCameraFusionEnabled`](avcaptureresolvedphotosettings/isdualcamerafusionenabled.md) setting will always be false).",
      "ko": "장치가 이미지 퓨전을 지원하지 않으면 [`isAutoDualCameraFusionEnabled`](avcapturephotosettings/isautodualcamerafusionenabled.md) 속성을 설정해도 효과가 없습니다(즉, 해석된 [`isDualCameraFusionEnabled`](avcaptureresolvedphotosettings/isdualcamerafusionenabled.md) 값은 항상 false입니다).",
      "sourceHash": "c1550a5df648d77afb8b3e85ef1eed72ffbfb6e51caf2d7da131157b88b34078",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "**Note**: This property’s value can change if the [`sessionPreset`](avcapturesession/sessionpreset.md) property of the current capture session or the [`activeFormat`](avcapturedevice/activeformat.md) property of the underlying capture device changes.",
      "ko": "**Note**: 현재 캡처 세션의 [`sessionPreset`](avcapturesession/sessionpreset.md) 속성이나 기본 캡처 장치의 [`activeFormat`](avcapturedevice/activeformat.md) 속성이 변경되면 이 속성 값이 변경될 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "6ebdced778d35dd8229de173268741aca8cddbf72fb7a9dcb1b7244239cc9d7a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "This property supports key-value observing.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 키-값 관찰을 지원합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d191ec2919976839580c125b2fe0468e3c46d7fe0f54949bb4493094ada7e47e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
